---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "The Social Notebook | Joe Sheldon"
description: "A collection of posts, notes, and articles written by Joe, his team, and his network."
permalink: /cms/notebook/index.html
---

<main class="layout-container layout-stack-main">

  <header class="surface-bento page-hero-bento">
    <h1 class="text-page-title">The Social Notebook</h1>
    <p class="text-body page-hero-lead">
      A collection of posts, notes, and articles written by Joe, his team, and his network.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="section-divider"></div>

  <section id="notebook-feed" data-nav-title="Dispatches" class="content-section-centered">
    <div class="section-grid-static grid-cols-1">
      
      {% for item in notebook %}
        {% if item.hold_status == 'active' %}
          <article class="surface-bento pathway-item-card">
            
            <div class="card-header-split">
              <span class="text-overline text-accent-alpine">
                {{ (item.cities[0] | upper) if item.cities and item.cities.length else "DISPATCH" }}
              </span>
              {% if item.published_at %}
                <time class="text-body-secondary tabular-nums">
                  {{ item.published_at }}
                </time>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-widget-title">
              <a href="/cms/notebook/{{ item.slug }}/" class="title-link">
                {{ item.title }}
              </a>
            </h2>

            <div class="text-body section-body-prose">
              {{ item.body | safe }}
            </div>

            <div class="card-footer-strip text-body-secondary">
              <div class="cms-card-byline">
                <span>By </span>
                <strong class="text-primary-charcoal">{{ item.author }}</strong>
                <span> &bull; {{ item.author_role }}</span>
              </div>

              <div class="card-actions-group">
                <a href="/chat/?topic={{ item.title | urlencode }}" class="btn btn-secondary">
                  <span>Reply</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/cms/notebook/{{ item.slug }}/" class="btn btn-primary">
                  <span>Read &rarr;</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

          </article>
        {% endif %}
      {% else %}
        <div class="surface-bento callout-feature-card">
          <p class="text-body-secondary">No dispatches published yet. Check back soon for field notes and market commentary.</p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}

    </div>
  </section>

</main>